{"operations":[{"content":"def chunk(data, size):\n    \"\"\"Yield successive chunks from data of given size.\n\n    If the length of data is not a multiple of size, the final partial chunk is yielded.\n    If size is larger than the length of data, a single chunk containing all data is yielded.\n\n    Args:\n        data (bytes): The input data to chunk.\n        size (int): The chunk size.\n\n    Yields:\n        bytes: Chunks of data.\n    \"\"\"\n    if size <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Chunk size must be positive\")\n    for i in range(0, len(data), size):\n        yield data[i:i + size]\n","expected_sha256":"7016a2b0dd284435e6f15970d4ba190d6386f23bccd03385aede97ee462ae675","kind":"modify","path":"src/chunking.py"}],"rationale":"Modified the chunk function to yield the final partial chunk when data length is not a multiple of chunk size, and to yield one chunk if size is larger than input length, preserving the public API and existing tests."}